  "body_html": "<h1>Best Response</h1>\n<p>A strategy $\\sigma_i$ is a best response for player $i$ to the profile $\\sigma$ if\nno unilateral deviation can improve $i$'s payoff:</p>\n<p>$$\\forall s'_i \\in S_i, \\quad u_i(\\sigma[i \\mapsto s'_i]) \\le u_i(\\sigma).$$</p>\n<h2>References</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>[MSZ, Chapter 2, Section 2.4] Maschler, Solan, and Zamir, <em>Game Theory</em>, <code>references/GameTheory.pdf</code>. Definition of best response.</li>\n</ul>",
  "proof_html": null,
